---
layout: changelog
title: "Appwrite Sites get dynamic API keys"
date: 2026-09-16
tags: sites, security, console
---

[Appwrite Sites](/docs/products/sites) now generates a [dynamic API key](/docs/products/sites/develop#dynamic-api-key) for every site build and every server-side rendering (SSR) request. The key carries only the scopes granted to the site and expires shortly after the request's timeout, so server-rendered sites can send OTPs, provision resources, or accept anonymous submissions without an `APPWRITE_API_KEY` variable.

Appwrite provides the key as the `APPWRITE_SITE_API_KEY` environment variable during the build and on the `x-appwrite-key` request header at run time. Grant scopes to a site from the **Scopes** card under **Settings** > **Build** in the Console, or with the `scopes` parameter on the create and update site endpoints.

